# ui/package-lock.json IS in the repo on purpose: board.css is a checked-in artifact, and
# the devDependencies use caret ranges. Without the lockfile the next `npm install` gives a
# different Tailwind/daisyUI patch and therefore a different board.css — and the diff is
# minified onto one line, i.e. unreadable. The lockfile is what makes "reproducible" true.
